WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.655 --> 00:00:03.724
- Oh yes, my paycheck!

00:00:03.724 --> 00:00:04.621
Yes!

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:06.067
I'll finally start a savings account,

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.555
pay rent on time and

00:00:07.555 --> 00:00:09.247
maybe buy a new jacket for once.

00:00:09.247 --> 00:00:10.869
(phone vibrating)

00:00:11.615 --> 00:00:12.523
Hello.

00:00:12.523 --> 00:00:14.635
- [Voiceover] Hello I'm
calling for Milo Rights.

00:00:14.635 --> 00:00:15.654
- Milo, hi.

00:00:15.654 --> 00:00:16.259
- [Voiceover] Hi,

00:00:16.259 --> 00:00:18.182
this is the Student
Loan Collection Service.

00:00:18.182 --> 00:00:19.343
You owe us.

00:00:19.343 --> 00:00:22.264
(upbeat pop music)

00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:27.446
- Uh, okay.

00:00:27.446 --> 00:00:29.234
Hey, can I give you a call back?

00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:31.254
- [Voiceover] Sure, just give
us a call back at 1-800--

00:00:31.254 --> 00:00:32.132
- Shut up!

00:00:32.414 --> 00:00:34.897
Okay, ten extra hours per week at the job,

00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:37.522
plus the minimum student loan payment

00:00:37.522 --> 00:00:39.192
equals

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.981
me paying them off in 43 years.

00:00:41.981 --> 00:00:43.049
Cool.

00:00:43.049 --> 00:00:45.156
(phone vibrating)

00:00:45.557 --> 00:00:47.272
Hello.

00:00:48.297 --> 00:00:50.591
Are you calling me from
a different number?

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:54.283
Girls wanted $900 a night.

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:56.303
Hmm.

00:00:57.817 --> 00:00:59.928
Must be into foot stuff, alright.

00:00:59.928 --> 00:01:02.344
Let me ask you a question,
what's your name?

00:01:02.344 --> 00:01:04.109
Oh Brenda, that's a nice.

00:01:04.109 --> 00:01:05.450
My grandmother's name.

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:08.238
Um, did you ever have student loans or.

00:01:08.892 --> 00:01:11.023
(phone vibrating)

00:01:13.256 --> 00:01:14.806
(incoming text message beep)

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:19.082
(outgoing text message beep)

00:01:20.524 --> 00:01:22.524
How do you sleep at night, Brenda?

00:01:22.524 --> 00:01:24.148
How do you sleep at night?

00:01:24.148 --> 00:01:25.400
You're a monster!

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.515
No I don't have any money.

00:01:26.515 --> 00:01:28.280
I can't afford to pay you.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:31.013
Five dollars is too
much, that's ridiculous.

00:01:32.251 --> 00:01:35.101
(phone vibrating)

00:01:35.223 --> 00:01:36.261
Uh!

00:01:37.615 --> 00:01:38.403
Hello.

00:01:38.403 --> 00:01:39.727
- [Voiceover] Hi, we're
calling from your alma mater.

00:01:39.727 --> 00:01:41.375
Would you like to make a
donation to the school?

00:01:41.375 --> 00:01:42.925
- Are you serious?

00:01:43.999 --> 00:01:46.361
(phone vibrating)

00:01:47.159 --> 00:01:47.855
Hello Mom.

00:01:47.855 --> 00:01:49.803
- [Voiceover] Hey baby, your
nephew got into college.

00:01:49.803 --> 00:01:50.802
- Oh no.

00:01:50.802 --> 00:01:52.427
- [Voiceover] Don't worry,
on a full ride scholarship.

00:01:52.427 --> 00:01:53.495
- Oh, well that's great.

00:01:53.495 --> 00:01:55.186
Good for him, yay college.

00:01:55.186 --> 00:01:57.432
(upbeat pop music)

